# LanceHive Frontend — Core Standards

**Stack (non-negotiable):** React 19 · TypeScript (strict) · TanStack Query · Zustand · Tailwind CSS · shadcn/ui · Vite

**Golden rule:** Every page and feature is composed from pre-built UI components (shadcn/ui primitives + project shared components). Never hand-roll buttons, inputs, dialogs, tables, or layout shells when shadcn or a shared component exists.

**API contract:** Read `docs/user-journey-api.md` before building any feature. Types must mirror the backend schema.

**Standards:** Read task **Done when** in `docs/development-plan.md`. Follow `docs/standards/` (testing, errors, naming, security, commits, DoD).

**Agent tone:** Explain issues in plain English. Avoid jargon unless defined.

**Token guard:** `ai-token-guard.mdc` — minimum reads, docs, and output. One development-plan task block at a time.

**Before shipping any page or audit:** Run the five-area review in `audit-deliverables.mdc` and produce all required deliverables.
